{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e08-scene-13",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "北海道に帰れ  (Go Back to Hokkaido)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "toshi": "トシ"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After pulling Toshi off Kawada, Muranishi makes the most painful decision of his career—telling his loyal partner since Sapporo to return to Hokkaido because he cannot forgive Toshi ruining himself for him.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺はお前を信用してる。だけどもう無理だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "北海道に帰れ。あっちでゆっくり過ごせ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ちょっと待てよ、許してくれよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あんたのためにやったんだぞ。分かってんだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "分かってる。分かってるから許せないんだよ、トシ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "許してくれよ、ずっと一緒にやってきただろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もう終わりだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まだ終わんねえよ！これからだろうがよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "これからガンガン稼いで、一緒にいい景色見るんだろうがよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "出てってくれ。頼む。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "後悔すんぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もうしてる。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺はお前を信用してる。だけどもう無理だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have always trusted you. Yet we cannot go on anymore.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "北海道に帰れ。あっちでゆっくり過ごせ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go back to Hokkaido. Live a quiet life up there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ちょっと待てよ、許してくれよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait a second, please forgive me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あんたのためにやったんだぞ。分かってんだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I did all of it for you. You know that, don't you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "分かってる。分かってるから許せないんだよ、トシ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do know. Because I know, I cannot forgive it, Toshi.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "許してくれよ、ずっと一緒にやってきただろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Forgive me, we built everything together from the start, didn't we?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もう終わりだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is over now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まだ終わんねえよ！これからだろうがよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is not over! We are just getting started!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "これからガンガン稼いで、一緒にいい景色見るんだろうがよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We were going to earn big and see the view from the top together!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "出てってくれ。頼む。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Leave, please. I am begging you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "後悔すんぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are going to regret this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "もうしてる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I already regret it.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
